	(text_box "Q1902 DCDC_AIR GATE DRIVE / WORST CASE\n\nBestueckung:\nQ1902 = IPD95R750P7\nU1901, U1902 = TCLT1004\nU1904 = SN74LVC2G14DBV\nR1902 = 100R\nR1903 = 100k\nR1904 = 1k\nR1905 = 330R\nR1906 = 10k\nD1902 = Gate-Source-Zener/TVS ca. 7...10V\n\nIPD95R750P7:\nV_DS,max = 950V\nV_GS(th) = 2.5...3.5V\nV_plateau,typ = 4.4V\nR_DS(on),max = 0.75R @ V_GS = 10V\nAchtung: R_DS(on) bei V_GS ~= 5V ist nicht garantiert.\nV_DS,on, V_GS und Temperatur im ProtoA messen.\n\nU1901 Eingang:\nIF_U1901,min = (3.3V - 1.6V) / 330R = 5.15mA\nIF_U1901,typ ~= (3.3V - 1.25V) / 330R = 6.21mA\nIF_limit TCLT1004 = 60mA\n=> U1901 LED-Strom OK\n\nR1905 Verlustleistung:\nP_R1905,typ ~= (3.3V - 1.25V)^2 / 330R = 12.7mW\n=> R1905 thermisch unkritisch\n\nU1901 Ausgangsreserve:\nCTR_U1901,min = 160% @ IF = 5mA\nIC_U1901,min = 1.60 * 5.15mA = 8.2mA\n\nGate-Endspannung Q1902:\nV_G,Q1902,final,worst ~= 5.0V - VCEsat,U1901\nVCEsat,U1901,worst ~= 0.3V\n=> V_GS,Q1902,final,worst ~= 4.7V\n\nU1901 Strombedarf bei V_GS ~= 4.7V:\nI_R1903 = 4.7V / 100k = 0.047mA\nI_R1904_U1902 = (4.7V - 1.6V) / 1k = 3.1mA\nI_U1901_req ~= 3.2mA\n\n=> U1901 Reserve = 8.2mA / 3.2mA = Faktor 2.6\n=> Gate-Endspannung Q1902 worst case ca. 4.7V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 95.0421 0)
		(size 44.45 62.4379)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
